[05:14.95] Listen!
[05:16.91] 
[05:46.29] Crying back to consciousness, the coldness grips my skin
[05:55.34] The sky is pitching violently, drawn by shrieking winds
[06:06.19] Seaspray blurs my vision, waves roll by so fast
[06:15.47] Save my ship of freedom, I'm lashed helpless to the mast
[06:24.79] 
[06:52.18] Remembering when first I held the wheel in my own hands
[07:03.28] I took the helm so eagerly and sailed for distant lands
[07:13.20] But now the sea's too heavy
[07:17.43] And I just, I just don't understand
[07:22.57] Why must my crew desert me when I need, I need a guiding hand?
[07:40.16] Call out for direction and there's no one there to steer
[07:49.46] Shout out for salvation, but there's no one there to hear
[07:58.71] Cry out supplication, for the maelstrom is near
[08:07.74] Scream out desperation, but no one cares to hear
[08:16.79] 
[09:54.22] The whiteness of confusion is unfolding from my mind
[10:03.58] I stare around in wonder, have I left my life behind?
[10:14.21] I catch the scent of ambergris
[10:19.45] And turn my head, surprised
[10:24.78] My gaze is caught and held
[10:28.33] And I am helpless, mesmerized
[10:34.91] 
[10:38.09] Panacea, liquid grace
[10:48.15] Oh, let me touch your fragile face
[10:58.06] Enchantment falls around me
[11:02.01] And I know I cannot leave
[11:08.73] 
[11:26.28] Here's a meaning for my life
[11:30.17] A shelter from the storm
[11:36.19] Pacify my troubles with her body, soft and warm
[11:45.31] Naked in our unity, a smile for every tear
[11:55.70] Gentle hands that promise me comfort through the years
[12:05.12] Yet I know I must be gone
[12:09.99] Before the light of dawn
[12:14.73] 
[12:17.76] Panacea, passion pure
[12:27.12] I can't resist your gentle lure
[12:37.03] My heart will lie beside you
[12:42.95] And my wandering body grieves
[12:51.07] 
[13:13.30] Another endless day, silhouettes of grey
[13:22.01] Another glass of wine, drink with eyes that shine
[13:29.54] Today's without that chill at morning
[13:33.70] Long night's time out of mind
[13:38.40] 
[13:42.64] Draw another goblet from the cask of '43
[13:50.72] Crimson misty memory, hazy glimpse of me
[13:59.27] Give me back my wonder, I've something more to give
[14:07.41] I guess it doesn't matter
[14:11.03] There's not much more to, not much more to live
[14:20.82] Another foggy dawn, the mountain almost gone
[14:29.23] Another doubtful fear, the road is not so clear
[14:37.01] My soul grows ever weary and the end is ever near
[14:45.55] 
[14:50.04] Draw another goblet from the cask of '43
[14:58.18] Crimson misty memory, hazy glimpse of me
[15:06.70] Give me back my wonder, I've something more to give
[15:14.68] I guess it doesn't matter
[15:18.18] There's not much more to, not much more to live
