[16:29.24] See the steps grow lighter as I reach their final few
[16:33.29] Hear the dancing waters, I must be drawing near
[16:37.64] Feel, my heart is pounding with embattled hope and fear
[16:53.51] Now, at last I fall before the Fountain of Lamneth
[16:58.39] I thought I would be singing, but I'm tired, out of breath
[17:03.45] Many journeys end here, but the secret's told the same
